# AC-07 — Cross-Session Memory Persistence

**Criteria:** AC-07 (deterministically scored)  
**Generated:** 2026-09-09T18:41:46+00:00  
**Regenerate:** `python scripts/generate_evidence.py`

> All data is synthetic. Identifiers are pseudonymised in traces (NFR-05).

---

Session 1 writes facts and exits. Session 2 runs as a **separate OS process** — a
fresh interpreter with no shared objects and no warm caches — and recalls them.
Two in-process instances could share a page cache; two processes cannot.

